  data: {
    LLM: "1. **Lead**: Player to dealer's left leads. Winner of each trick leads the next. 2. **Play**: Any card may be led. Must follow suit if possible; if void, may play any card. No trumpsâ€”highest card of the suit led wins. 3. **La Politaine**: If a player holds 10-9-A of a suit and wins three consecutive tricks with them, announce before playing the first card; team scores 11-point bonus. 4. **Scoring**: At end of hand, count points: Aces 1 each; 10,9,K,Q,J 1/3 each; 8,7 nothing; last trick 1. Fractional points ignored; total 11 per hand. 5. **Winning**: First team to 31+ wins. Tie at 33: play another deal.",
    Player: "1. **Lead**: Player to dealer's left leads. Winner of each trick leads the next. 2. **Play**: Any card may be led. Must follow suit if possible; if void, may play any card. No trumpsâ€”highest card of the suit led wins. 3. **La Politaine**: If a player holds 10-9-A of a suit and wins three consecutive tricks with them, announce before playing the first card; team scores 11-point bonus. 4. **Scoring**: At end of hand, count points: Aces 1 each; 10,9,K,Q,J 1/3 each; 8,7 nothing; last trick 1. Fractional points ignored; total 11 per hand. 5. **Winning**: First team to 31+ wins. Tie at 33: play another deal.",
    objective: 'Win tricks to score points. First team to reach 31 or more wins. Four sevens in hand wins the game instantly. La Politaine (10-9-A of a suit) used to win three consecutive tricks scores an 11-point bonus.',
    gameplay: "1. **Lead**: Player to dealer's left leads. Winner of each trick leads the next. 2. **Play**: Any card may be led. Must follow suit if possible; if void, may play any card. No trumpsâ€”highest card of the suit led wins. 3. **La Politaine**: If a player holds 10-9-A of a suit and wins three consecutive tricks with them, announce before playing the first card; team scores 11-point bonus. 4. **Scoring**: At end of hand, count points: Aces 1 each; 10,9,K,Q,J 1/3 each; 8,7 nothing; last trick 1. Fractional points ignored; total 11 per hand. 5. **Winning**: First team to 31+ wins. Tie at 33: play another deal.",
    keyRules: [
      'No trumps. Highest card of the suit led wins the trick.',
